OL,3,GNEWSAThe Feeling album was recorded in
OL,4,Aa Sussex shed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Feeling's triple-platinum debut
OL,7,Falbum was recorded in a shed in
OL,8,FHorsham, according to frontman Dan
OL,9,FGillespie Sells.
OL,11,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Sussex as the
OL,12,Frecord marks its 20th anniversary,
OL,13,FGillespie Sells said it came from "a
OL,14,Fvery different world" when music fans
OL,15,Fbought CDs and "nobody had an iPhone".
OL,17,FThe singer said much of Twelve Stops
OL,18,Fand Home was made at the Sussex home of
OL,19,Fbrothers and bandmates Kevin and Ciaran
OL,20,FJeremiah.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
